name gutenberg-sloane
# The Standard Electrical Dictionary by T. O'Connor Sloane (Project Gutenberg eBook #36776).
# Each entry is a paragraph separated by an empty line: the headword line first, followed by its definition lines.
match standard-electrical-dictionary-sloane.txt
witness The Standard Electrical Dictionary
lineage Project Gutenberg
class UserCuratedResource
tier entry by \n\n
names headword definition...
tier line by \n
where headword matches ^[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9 ,.'()-]+\.$
content headword definition
thing entry headword
pair entry definition
